  "sourceTitle": "Introducing ConTextual: How well can your Multimodal model jointly reason over text and image in text-rich scenes?",
  "sourceBodyHash": "9ca5fe43fef4f16267d91cde148c5dc94882b97ec490bb9db615457461e8c283",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "nowcoding",
  "requestedModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-12T05:15:40.495307Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-12T05:29:01.772524Z",
  "totalBlocks": 61,
  "translatedBlocks": 61,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab8216c13b080799",
      "translationZh": "模型已经相当擅长理解文本本身，但对于图像中提供重要上下文信息的文本，它们的表现又如何呢？例如，根据地图导航，或理解一张梗图？对图像中的文本与视觉上下文之间的相互作用进行推理的能力，可以为许多现实应用提供支持，例如 AI 助手，或帮助视障人士的工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d177d23cd3875356",
      "translationZh": "我们将这些任务称为“上下文敏感的富文本视觉推理任务”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb30403058987e13",
      "translationZh": "目前，对经过指令微调的大型多模态模型（LMMs）的大多数评估，都侧重于测试模型能否很好地响应针对图像、以问题或祈使句形式提出的人类指令（“数一数这个”“列出那个”等）……却没有测试它们能否很好地理解上下文敏感的富文本场景！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e66fe6d5e3e2903",
      "translationZh": "这就是我们（来自加利福尼亚大学洛杉矶分校的研究人员）创建 ConTextual 的原因。它是一个用于评估 LMMs 的上下文敏感富文本视觉推理数据集。我们还发布了一个排行榜，让社区能够自行了解哪些模型最擅长这项任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a7e67e53fb2647f",
      "translationZh": "若想深入了解，你也可以查看以下补充资源：论文、代码、数据集、验证数据集和排行榜。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6574a26c987b83a7",
      "translationZh": "什么是 ConTextual",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60215d05fd64ccba",
      "translationZh": "ConTextual 是一个上下文敏感的富文本视觉推理数据集，包含 506 条具有挑战性的指令，用于评估 LMM。我们针对富文本图像创建了一组多样化的指令，并要求这些指令必须需要结合图像中的文本线索和视觉线索进行上下文敏感的联合推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c775a24007fec4b7",
      "translationZh": "它涵盖了 8 种现实世界中的视觉场景——时间读取、购物、导航、抽象场景、移动应用、网页、信息图和其他自然场景。（每个数据集的示例见图。）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5154d48d2ed3781",
      "translationZh": "每个样本包含：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9292090328fcd67b",
      "translationZh": "一张包含丰富文本的图像",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0d038319cdb9e94a",
      "translationZh": "一条人工编写的指令（问题或命令式任务）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "396822ebc3be47a9",
      "translationZh": "一条人工编写的参考回复",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6463288b17dd753b",
      "translationZh": "该数据集以两种形式发布：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2178925a2df3895b",
      "translationZh": "(a) 一个验证集，包含从完整数据集中选取的 100 个实例，每个实例均包含指令、图像以及针对指令的参考答案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "af0638b812c766b4",
      "translationZh": "(b) 一个仅包含指令和图像的测试数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4089536805efd17",
      "translationZh": "排行榜包含模型在验证集和测试数据集上的结果（这些信息也包含在论文中）。开发集使实践者能够轻松测试并迭代改进其方法。评估沙箱位于我们的 github 中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "716b52c42e952750",
      "translationZh": "实验",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb2ac1394075904d",
      "translationZh": "在初步实验中，我们的基准测试评估了 13 个模型的性能。我们将它们分为三类：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a7369652db51a971",
      "translationZh": "增强型 LLM 方法：GPT4 + 以图像 OCR 和/或密集图像描述形式提供的视觉信息；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d20467be4a1fe22c",
      "translationZh": "闭源 LMM：GPT4V(ision) 和 Gemini-Vision-Pro；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cf7ddc736a4cba66",
      "translationZh": "开源 LMM：LLaVA-v1.5-13B、ShareGPT4V-7B、Instruct-Blip-Vicuna-7B、mPlugOwl-v2-7B、Bliva-Vicuna-7B、Qwen-VL-7B 和 Idefics-9B。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d60d5794bbbb720",
      "translationZh": "我们的数据集为每条指令提供了参考回答，使我们能够测试各种自动评估方法。在评估时，我们采用 LLM-as-a-judge 方法，并将指令、参考回答和预测回答作为提示提供给 GPT-4。模型必须判定预测回答是否可接受。（我们选择 GPT4，是因为在我们的实验中，它与人类判断的相关性最高。）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbf042f6d7576ea5",
      "translationZh": "让我们来看一些示例！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d8a37d3a5b07334",
      "translationZh": "示例 1 在这个例子中，尽管 GPT-4V 进行了逻辑推理，它仍然对指令给出了错误的回答。绿色表示与参考回答相符的回答，红色则突出显示回答中的错误。此外，还提供了推理摘要，用于概述 GPT-4V 得出答案时所依据的推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24355dd83ea0901a",
      "translationZh": "示例 2 在这个示例中，GPT-4V 正确响应了指令。然而，ShareGPT-4V-7B（表现最好的开源 LMM）和 GPT-4 w/ Layout-aware OCR + Caption（增强型 LLM）由于缺乏对文本和图像进行联合推理的能力，给出了错误的回答。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e9247c1d1dc6e4d",
      "translationZh": "你可以在我们论文的附录部分找到更多这样的示例！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "383daeb90716748e",
      "translationZh": "关键结论！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd747a5f6812cdf5",
      "translationZh": "在开展这项工作的过程中，我们发现：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8147d3fccddda898",
      "translationZh": "现代 LMM（专有模型和开放模型）在 ConTextual 数据集上表现不佳，而人类则表现出色，这表明模型仍有改进空间，可以增强其对富文本图像的推理能力，而这一领域具有重要的现实应用价值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "83b06c39aa541229",
      "translationZh": "专有 LMM 在涉及时间读取的信息图推理中表现不佳，表明其能力与人类相比存在差距。值得注意的是，表现最好的模型 GPT-4V 在抽象推理方面超越了人类，这可能是因为它接触过网络迷因和引语数据，但在涉及时间的任务中表现吃力，而人类在这类任务中表现出色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "78b532204254c179",
      "translationZh": "对于 LLaVA-1.5-13B 和 ShareGPT-4V-7B 等开源模型，它们在人类评分达到可接受水平的领域（抽象情境和自然场景情境）与其他领域（时间读取、信息图、导航、购物、网页和移动设备使用）之间存在显著差距。因此，我们样本涵盖的许多领域很可能对这些模型而言属于分布外领域。因此，开源模型应致力于提高训练数据的多样性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "150c319ff3122603",
      "translationZh": "使用大型语言模型来增强 LMM，让大型语言模型接收通过 OCR 或图像描述转换为文本的视觉信息，这种做法表现尤其糟糕，人类认可率仅为 17.2%。要解决我们的样本中的问题，需要将精确的视觉感知与细粒度、能够捕捉微妙差异的视觉—语言对齐相结合。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5af9bc396d5eeed",
      "translationZh": "我们的分析表明，值得探索的下一步方向包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "df6c5279b946a398",
      "translationZh": "开发更强的图像编码器，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "476abe7a8d465d7f",
      "translationZh": "生成高度准确的图像描述，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b8b715913fefdd1b",
      "translationZh": "促进细粒度的视觉与语言对齐，以提升模型的感知能力并减少幻觉的发生。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0eb2ca979383b343",
      "translationZh": "这进而将使模型能够更有效地开展对上下文敏感、涉及丰富文本的视觉推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7ad7aa27712dc30e",
      "translationZh": "下一步是什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cab1cc6bd43edd6f",
      "translationZh": "我们也很希望评估你们的模型，共同推动视觉语言模型的发展！如需提交，请遵循下方的指南。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d70bdd739179606",
      "translationZh": "我们希望这一基准能够帮助开发精细的视觉与语言对齐技术，并欢迎任何形式的合作！你可以在这里联系我们：Rohan 和 Hritik，也可以在这里进一步了解团队：Rohan、Hritik、Kai-Wei Chang、Nanyun (Violet) Peng。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9f18e5d1a04c285d",
      "translationZh": "如何提交？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78c1c136862bdf62",
      "translationZh": "我们接受测试集和验证集的结果提交。请按照下方相应的流程操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "42617798d3bd5210",
      "translationZh": "验证集结果提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61f132a43cb7d4af",
      "translationZh": "要将验证结果提交至排行榜，你可以按照这些说明，运行我们的自动评估代码（使用 GPT4 的评估流水线）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6e32addf22f1f15",
      "translationZh": "我们要求提交内容采用 json 格式，如下所示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "30050264ba9de1a9",
      "translationZh": "将 model name 替换为你的模型名称（字符串）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0176d29c59d9904f",
      "translationZh": "将 img_url 替换为该实例的 img_url（字符串）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aa1416b6a221d6f4",
      "translationZh": "img url 对应的值为 0 或 1（整数）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff5ed3f3602044c7",
      "translationZh": "应有 100 个预测结果，分别对应验证集中的 100 个 URL。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97d971f2a87cfa6f",
      "translationZh": "要提交结果，请前往托管在 HuggingFace 上的排行榜，并填写提交表单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "21e5607e7f91c01c",
      "translationZh": "测试集提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0264fab7b91f966b",
      "translationZh": "当你对验证结果满意后，可以将模型预测结果发送给 Rohan 和 Hritik。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d40c27f19b2c5c0",
      "translationZh": "请在电子邮件中包含以下内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2fb5b82ff5a01c55",
      "translationZh": "你的模型名称。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "beb1331ef4cc50bb",
      "translationZh": "组织（所属机构）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0a247e7f0f5cebdf",
      "translationZh": "（可选）GitHub 仓库或论文链接。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a39186744d0cdb8",
      "translationZh": "我们要求提交内容采用 json 格式，与验证集的格式类似，如下所示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "30050264ba9de1a9",
      "translationZh": "将模型名称替换为你的模型名称（字符串）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0176d29c59d9904f",
      "translationZh": "将 img_url 替换为该实例的 img_url（字符串）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
